module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.inflation_fold_cannot_name_the_environment_it_measures

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }
import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, WholeDeclaration }

data inflation_fold_cannot_name_the_environment_it_measures: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "inflation_fold_cannot_name_the_environment_it_measures" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**an analysis holds WORK constant so that only ENVIRONMENT can differ, and carries no field naming which environment either side ran in** (INVALID STATE: `identity_inflation_permille_at_equal_work` pairs rows across two runs by identity AND by equal `eval_steps`, precisely so that a difference in CPU denotes environment rather than work. `RunCost` carries `run: NonEmptyStr` -- WHICH run, never WHERE. `FloorCostRow` carries identity, module, verdict_reached, cost, eval_steps, reachability. `claim_cost_required_columns` names eight columns and none is a runner, host class or architecture. So two runs from different machine populations pair and produce a confident permille figure, and nothing in the fold can notice. HARM: the one variable the analysis exists to isolate is the one it cannot express, so its output is a number about an unnamed mixture. ",

    "WHAT MAKES THIS DIFFERENT FROM AN ORDINARY MISSING FIELD, and why it is filed rather than fixed in passing: the fold is CAREFUL. It refuses right-censored readings, refuses unequal step counts, refuses below a minimum base cost. A reader sees three refusals and reasonably concludes the fold is defensive. It is defensive about everything except its own subject. ",

    "IT IS PROTECTED TODAY BY UNREACHABILITY AND NOT BY A WALL, which is the section 4b distinction exactly. Every reading currently comes from CI, so every pair is same-population BY ACCIDENT. The invalid state is fully writable; what prevents it is that nothing can yet produce a reading from anywhere else. The moment a harvester or a local actuator emits into the same artifact, the protection is gone -- so the rung is not what the absence of specimens suggests. ",

    "SPECIMEN OF THE NEAR MISS, 2026-09-07. A lane investigating an intermittent per-claim cost refusal measured the subject repeatedly on remote build executors and separately read figures from the required-lane CI runner, and was one step from comparing them. The comparison was refused on the ground that the two are different machine populations. The same lane was then authorised to build the harvester that would have fed local readings into this fold, checked for the provenance field BEFORE emitting, and found none. Nothing executing would have objected. ",

    "THE REPAIR IS NOT A COLUMN. Provenance is a fact about the RUN and not the row -- every row in one artifact ran in one place -- so a constant-across-rows column would be a per-row representation of a per-run fact, which is the redundancy section 2 names. It belongs on `RunCost`, read once from the header, with the cross-population comparison a check between two values rather than a fold over pairs. ",

    "AND A FIELD ALONE IS THE SAME DEFECT ONE LAYER UP, which this module has already been caught on once: its own comments record that `verdict_reached` sat in the artifact UNREAD while the consumer folded censored bounds into a histogram, and that a discriminator a consumer must remember to join on is a warning and not a wall. The parser must REFUSE an artifact whose header carries no provenance rather than defaulting it, because an unknown population silently treated as a known one is the same hole with a better name; and the fold must JOIN on it. ",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: WHEN AN ANALYSIS HOLDS ONE VARIABLE CONSTANT SO THAT ANOTHER MAY BE READ, CHECK THAT THE SECOND VARIABLE IS REPRESENTED IN THE CARRIER. A FOLD THAT CANNOT NAME ITS OWN SUBJECT REFUSES EVERYTHING EXCEPT BEING WRONG ABOUT IT. ",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: mitigatable -- no specimen has been produced, because no producer outside CI exists, and the near miss was caught by a reviewer's judgement rather than by anything executing. CEILING: structurally impossible, since a pairing that cannot be constructed from two differently-provenanced runs has no invalid state to validate; the population is a modeled fact and the decidable check is equality of two declared values. ",

    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, a capability: `RunCost` carries a declared machine population, the artifact parser refuses a header that does not name one, and the pairing fold admits a pair only when both sides declare the same one -- sufficient that a cross-population inflation figure cannot be constructed rather than merely not occurring today.)",
  ],

  evidence: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.floor_cost_distribution", decl_name: "identity_inflation_permille_at_equal_work", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.floor_cost_distribution", decl_name: "RunCost", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.floor_cost_distribution", decl_name: "claim_cost_required_columns", field: WholeDeclaration },
  ],
}
